+ *
+ * The official app asks the console, before the BIG, for the list of Takion versions it can
+ * speak and uses the one in the ack; chiaki sends the BIG straight away with 12. This offers
+ * just 12 and 20 and switches if the console picks 20. Without an answer (older firmware) the
+ * stream goes on with 12, as before. From Takion 13 on, the BIG/BANG key exchange runs on
+ * secp521r1 with a 66 byte shared secret.
